# A Taste of Honey's available arm, the zoning flag alone (task 7 review of the mutants): Vanishing Act's 45 sets the
# flag and a Stage one minute on; after a JST day the Stage is past but the flag still holds, so Qutiba and Ulamaal
# answer 55 and 56; after a zone-out and back the same talks answer 579.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Qutiba/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/Ulamaal/onTrigger
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=92.341,-6.5,-127.5 job=WAR lvl=75
quest AhtUrhgan.DeliveringTheGoods completed
quest AhtUrhgan.VanishingAct accepted
charvar Quest[6][62]Prog 2
keyitem RainbowBerry
login
trigger Ulamaal                         # the berry: 45
finish                                  # completed; needToZone; A Taste of Honey's Stage now + 60
wait jst=1                              # past the Stage
trigger Qutiba                          # the flag holds: 55
finish
trigger Ulamaal                         # the flag holds: 56
finish
warp -64,-7,38 AlZahbi                  # the zoning flag cleared
warp 92.341,-6.5,-127.5 AhtUrhganWhitegate
trigger Qutiba                          # 579
finish option=0
